    "long_instructions": "> A city bus program uses this code to find a rider's fare:\r\n>\r\n> ```python\r\n> fare = 3\r\n> is_student = age < 25\r\n> if is_student:\r\n>     fare = 2\r\n> is_senior = age >= 65\r\n> if is_senior:\r\n>     fare = 1\r\n> ```\r\n>\r\n> 1. **Write a comment** to put above this code. Explain what the code is for, not what each line does.\r\n>\r\n> 2. Then **name the input and the output** of this code. For example, \"Input: ..., Output: ...\"",
